===Etymology===
[[w:Latin|Latin]][[Category:Latin derivations]] (meaning ''the right side'').
===Noun===
'''latus rectum'''

#{{geometry}} The [[line]] drawn through a [[focus]] of a [[conic section]] [[parallel]] to the [[directrix]] and [[terminate]]d both ways by the [[curve]]. It is the [[parameter]] of the [[principal axis]].

'''slack rectum'''

#{{geometry}} The [[loose]] expulsion of the gizzards brought about by excessive rectal exercise. Commonly known as sphintorial maximus (not to be confused with the Roman emperor, Anus Colonial Maximums.

